                                  (SESSION_ID,)).fetchall()
            target.executemany('INSERT INTO claim_loop_events VALUES (?,?,?,?,?,?,?,?)', rows)
            # A same-loop/sequence row in another namespace detects an incomplete
            # join key. Extra SQL columns remain part of exact cache identity.
